  "body": "> - button elements that are their form's default button\r\n>\r\n> - input elements whose type attribute is in the Submit Button or Image Button state, and that are their form's default button\r\n\r\nI think this could be collapsed down to:\r\n\r\n> Elements that are [default buttons](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#default-button)\r\n\r\nCan someone check me on this? @tkent-google. It seems like a nice simplification especially as we work on https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/187#issuecomment-490035174.",
